station-event-n14-raider-assault-announcement = Attention! A raider assault is being prepared on "{ $point }". Fortify your defenses.

n14-raider-assault-triggered = Signal sent. Raiders are moving on "{ $point }".
n14-raider-assault-no-point = No attack point with that identifier was found.
n14-raider-assault-no-spawners = The attack point exists, but no raiders are assigned to it.
n14-raider-assault-cap-reached = The point already has the maximum number of living raiders.
